<title>ROMANIA: Romania 91-day T-bill issue fully-subscribed.</title>
<headline>Romania 91-day T-bill issue fully-subscribed.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>An issue of 155.75 billion lei Romanian three-month treasury bills was fully subscribed on Thursday with banks' bids matching the Finance Ministry's offer, latest central bank data showed.</p>
<p>The T-bills, offering an annual yield of 49.4 percent, mature on February 13, 1997.</p>
<p>Next week, the Finance Ministry will offer some 992 billion lei worth of 91-day T-bills.</p>
<p>-- Mirela Eremia, Bucharest Newsroom 40-1 3120264</p>
</text>
